BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dead Man (1995)
DTSTART:20260114T023000Z
DTEND:20260114T045000Z
DTSTAMP:20260114T023000Z
UID:ggGdvANc6M
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 121 mins (2h01m)\n\nThe Pacific Northwestern Circums
 tances transform a mild mannered accountant into a notorious gunslinger in
  Jim Jarmusch’s quintessential psychedelic western\, an odyssey from the
  arid desert of the Southwest to the rugged coast of the Pacific Northwest
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-pacific-northwestern/dea
 d-man\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
