BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Ride Why
DTSTART:20260222T030000Z
DTEND:20260222T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20260222T030000Z
UID:8twWRN9ttr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nPresented by Cascade Bicycle Clu
 b and Cascade Bicycle Studio  We Ride Why is a documentary film about the
  power of love\, community\, and hope in the face of cancer. The film foll
 ows the stories of several women who have been impacted by cancer\, as wel
 l as the friends and family who support them. Through their stories\, we l
 earn about the collateral damage that cancer can bring\, but also the hope
  that can be found in the relationships that are born out of trauma.\n\nht
 tps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/we-ride-why-x40948\n\nEstimated star
 t: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
