UID:UCIWuLGssT
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nThe Pacific Northwestern A feckl
 ess gambler and cockney madame become successful business partners in the 
 burgeoning town of Presbyterian Church\, WA\, but trouble arrives in the f
 orm of a monopolizing corporation in Robert Altman’s quintessential drea
 m western. Presented on 35mm courtesy of the Chicago Film Society.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-pacific-northwestern/mccabe-and-m
 rs-miller\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
